# NAME: Anthropic / Claude
# AUTHOR: z285chen
# REPO: https://github.com/z285chen/Quantumult-X-Rules
# REVIEWED: 2026-10-22
# FORMAT: Quantumult X | POLICY: Anthropic | ACTIVE RULES: 10
# Sources, scope and import instructions: docs/Anthropic.md
# Shared dependencies below are commented; enable individual hosts as needed.

# Official product hosts: API, sign-in, downloads, previews, Artifacts and MCP Apps
HOST-SUFFIX,anthropic.com,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.ai,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.com,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.app,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claudeusercontent.com,Anthropic
HOST-SUFFIX,claudemcpcontent.com,Anthropic

# Developer blog linked from claude.com
HOST-SUFFIX,claude.dev,Anthropic

# Short links: community inventory; not in the official network requirements
HOST-SUFFIX,clau.de,Anthropic

# Official API inbound ranges; native Quantumult X syntax
IP-CIDR,160.79.104.0/23,Anthropic
IP6-CIDR,2607:6bc0::/48,Anthropic

# Optional SHARED hosts: enabling these also routes other apps using them.
# Claude Code plugin metadata and native installers before version 2.1.116
# HOST,storage.googleapis.com,Anthropic
# npm-based installs, plugin packages and npx-launched MCP servers
# HOST,registry.npmjs.org,Anthropic
# GitHub-hosted plugins / marketplaces and release notes
# HOST,github.com,Anthropic
# HOST,raw.githubusercontent.com,Anthropic
# Homebrew update checks
# HOST,formulae.brew.sh,Anthropic

# Optional SHARED Artifact fonts and JavaScript libraries
# HOST,fonts.googleapis.com,Anthropic
# HOST,fonts.gstatic.com,Anthropic
# HOST,cdnjs.cloudflare.com,Anthropic
# HOST,cdn.jsdelivr.net,Anthropic
# HOST,cdn.tailwindcss.com,Anthropic
# HOST,code.jquery.com,Anthropic
# HOST,unpkg.com,Anthropic

# Optional SHARED Claude Code telemetry and error reporting
# HOST,http-intake.logs.us5.datadoghq.com,Anthropic
# HOST,browser-intake-us5-datadoghq.com,Anthropic

# Optional ecosystem destinations
# Community inventory; endpoint purpose not independently verified
# HOST-SUFFIX,claudemcpclient.com,Anthropic
# MCP specification website; enable if you want its docs on this policy
# HOST-SUFFIX,modelcontextprotocol.io,Anthropic
